 "description": "<p>Polyester sweater with openwork knit and strapping across an open chest, sold with a matching short skirt, one size for 40-60 kg. The sweater-and-skirt pairing arrives as a set rather than leaving the bottom half to guesswork.</p>\n<p>The open-chest cut is structural - the straps cross where a collar would sit, which keeps the garment on without covering what the design exposes. Openwork knit ventilates the sweater enough for indoor wear year-round.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: top, short skirt</li>\n<li>Features: openwork, open-chest strap design</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The two-piece arrival is the convenience - no hunting for a skirt that suits the knit.</p>\n",
